#: flolens-pro/src/Integrations/Detect.php:80
msgid "A Clarity Data Export API token is still required to import numbers into FloLens (the plugin does not hold one)."
msgstr "Sigue siendo necesario un token de la Clarity Data Export API para importar cifras a FloLens (el plugin no guarda ninguno)."

#: flolens-pro/src/Integrations/Detect.php:100
msgid "A PostHog personal API key and project ID are still required to import numbers (the plugin does not hold them)."
